<p class="MsoToc1"><span class="MsoHyperlink"><span lang="EN-GB" style="mso-no-proof:yes" xml:lang="EN-GB">
<a href="#_Toc028235854">6<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span> Applications and Tools<span lang="EN-GB" class="MsoTocTextSpan" xml:lang="EN-GB">
